      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "OLINDAH (5) was an impressive come-from-behind winner fresh up, and has since hit the line strongly in another 2 starts. She tries 1400m for the first time, has Darmanin in the saddle, and can have the last say in this. SEDITIOUS AWARD (6) improved second up from a modest fresh effort to finishing third by a neck at long odds 10 days ago. She can make full use of the pole position here, and with Froggy Newitt on board, she can figure in the finish again. NIKOLSKY (4) will be peaking third up from a spell, and her only win came over this trip and the same stage of her last prep, so stick with her. RAPIDS AHEAD (7) has raced his way back into form and is worth including in all top 4 combos. WARRIOR SMILE (1) maps to get the right sort of run in this, and he is worth including in a race with many top 4 chances.",
